            "review_title": "Review at The Shamrock Irish Pub",
            "review_text": "Beth\nBristol, United Kingdom1150 contributions\n0\nGood auld Irish Pub!\nFeb 2020 • Couples\nCame in here for a few drinks and to escape the madness of the main street. Live music was on, singer and band were good  but too loud to hear anyone downstairs and very cold (aircon was too high) outside the front was full so we went upstairs which was totally empty. Played a few games of pool and sat on the balcony. Nice place but dial back on the aircon and turn the volume down a bit. We came in here to escape the noise of the other pubs and clubs.\nRead more\nWritten February 23, 2020",
