            "review_text": "My Ngo ELisa\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nHere is a great bar to come\nFeb 2020\nHere is a great bar to come and chat with friends. They are different to all the other bars as they have nice live music, the atmosphere is really chilled. They have a great menu with western and Vietnamese food. Really good quality and not too expensive! The cocktails are delicious and they have a happy hour which makes it even better! The staff are all friendly and will try to make sure you enjoy your time in the bar by putting on any sport you want.\nRead more\nWritten February 22, 2020",
