            "review_title": "Review at The Shamrock Irish Pub",
            "review_text": "Shannon M\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nGreat Irish Pub\nFeb 2020 • Friends\nHere is a great Irish bar in the middle of the city. They have on live music everyday which is such a nice change from the techno music in all the bars in the tourist area. The atmosphere here is really chilled out, they have great food and drinks. The staff are all super friendly and really make the experience. They always have some sports on, and they are happy to find any sort of sport that you want and put that on the big screen. They are very welcoming and will do anything they can to make sure you enjoy your time in the bar.\nRead more\nWritten February 22, 2020",
